url: https://gavinf97.github.io/dome-tutorial-maqc-2026/
abstract: >-
  Tutorial companion site for MAQC 2026 Technical Tutorial P06, "Publishing
  Reusable AI/ML Models in the Life Sciences", held on 23 September 2026 in
  Brescia, Italy. Covers the DOME recommendations for reporting supervised
  machine learning in biology, the DOME Registry, DOME Copilot, the Open and
  Sustainable AI (OSAI) recommendations, and three practical routes to
  producing a DOME transparency report.
